<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Dec 1-15 palm oil exports 406,924t - SGS.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Dec 1-15 palm oil exports 406,924t - SGS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo surveyor, Societe Generale de Surveillance (SGS) Malaysia Sdn Bhd said on Monday it estimated Malaysia's palm oil exports for December 1-15 at 406,924 tonnes compared with 298,862 tonnes for November 1-15.</p>
<p>It said the exports comprised 126,160 tonnes of RBD palm oil, 137,721 tonnes of RBD palm olein and 40,072 tonnes of RBD palm stearin. The other products accounted for 102,971 tonnes.  </p>
<p>SGS said China was the top buyer during the period, taking 64,480 tonnes followed by Pakistan which bought 45,520 tonnes, Japan (32,170 tonnes) and India (31,142 tonnes).</p>
<p>Countries in the European Union bought 57,172 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230-8911)</p>
</text>
